Questions thats should be answered in this project.
1. How does the total count of Movies compare to TV Shows on Netflix, and which category dominates overall? (For the Bar Visualisation -Movies vs TV Shows)
2. What is the percentage distribution of all content ratings on Netflix, and which rating categories are most common? (For the Pie Chart -Content Ratings)
3. How are Netflix movie durations distributed, and what duration range do most movies typically fall into? (For the Histogram -Movie Duration Distribution)
4. How many Netflix titles were released each year, and what trends or patterns can we observe over time? (For the Scatterplot -Releases per Year)
5. Which 20 countries contribute the most Netflix content, and how do their total counts compare? (For the Horizontal Bar Chart -Top 20 Countries)
6. How have the yearly release trends for Movies and TV Shows changed over time, and how do these two categories compare when viewed year-by-year? (For the Subplot with Two Line Plots -Movies vs TV Shows Over Years)
